2.53.0

Add a debug feature to validate all .eh_frame[_hdr] sections when first
loading the file rather than on demand.

Signed-off-by: Jens Remus <jremus@linux.ibm.com>
---

Notes (jremus):
    FIXME: dbg*() with UACCESS enabled.

